Bug 2062007 - Add category row and chip markup

Add the shared category row, translated controls, reusable chip markup, and bounded scrolling styles. Include keyboard, accessibility, theme, and layout coverage.

TB-Tools-Id: 36b017fc-5b26-4797-bd96-1ce7dda78098


